      "items": [
        "prepare 0.13 to 12.44 s: 12.31 s, of which the compute snapshot (Scaleway 9.33 s, Runpod 1.90 s) is 11.23 s, 91%",
        "Key check 1.04 s; everything else in prepare 0.04 s",
        "Session 1 (codex exec) 12.61 to 18.26 s: 5.64 s, of which the model call through the gateway 4.14 s (73%) and spawn_agent 0.99 s",
